WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:06.256
Now, the moment you've been waiting for!
The last performer is Cosmo,

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.675
the only herbivore dancer
of the Black Market!

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:12.846
Everyone, please enjoy with your nails
and fangs concealed at all times.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:19.436
The herbivores of the Black Market
are at the frontline of death.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.939
But I'm still here in this town

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.900
because, here, I can really be myself.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:32.115
I'll squeeze out as much money as I can
from the carnivores before it's too late.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.201
When I die, I'll allow myself
to be devoured to the fullest.

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:40.749
Now… my beasts.
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:46.463
The smell of a female herbivore,
bare without any clothes

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:51.843
is intensely more fresh and sweet

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:54.554
than meat butchered to eat.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:59.309
Let me stir up that chaos of appetite

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.352
and sexual desire.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:13.156
You're the ones in the cage.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:16.242
I'm the ruler here.

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:37.931
Who took away my stepladder?

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:39.891
I see.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.851
It was today.

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:43.853
The end of me.

00:01:51.319 --> 00:01:53.738
It's awfully charged up in here.

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:57.617
But the stage is a sacred place.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.621
Rude fellows who disrupt the performance

00:02:01.704 --> 00:02:03.998
don't have the right to be on stage.

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:09.254
Ill-mannered guests
will be disciplined by us.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.303
Are you okay?

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.101
Why is a herbivore in a place like this?

00:02:24.936 --> 00:02:26.896
What I despise the most

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.358
aren't the carnivores who want to eat me.

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:34.028
It's the carnivore guests who pity me,

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:36.781
and the herbivores
who come to watch just for fun!

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:39.701
Stand around like that
and you'll be eaten, too!

00:02:39.784 --> 00:02:41.995
Children should go home and go to bed!

00:02:42.078 --> 00:02:43.913
-Boss…
-What is it?

